  {
    "name": "hook-skill-gate",
    "description": "The skill-gate PreToolUse hook, which denies an edit until the session loads the skills the path needs; the repo keeps its rules in .claude/skill-gate.json and registers the hook in .claude/settings.json",
    "optIn": true,
    "files": [
